# GoodPlays ML (.NET)

## Projects

- `GoodPlays.Ml` — engines, training, inference interfaces
- Consumed by `GoodPlays.Api` via DI

## Current: Research engine

- `IRecommendationEngine` / `ResearchRecommendationEngine`
- 5 games per run; debounced per user
- LLM structured JSON → IGDB upsert → `RecommendationSnapshot`
- Config: `LLM__ApiKey`, model default `gpt-4o-mini`

## Phase 3: ML.NET hybrid

- `MatrixFactorizationTrainer` for CF
- Content features: genres, platforms, `game_type`, DLC via `parent_game_id`
- Nightly Hangfire train; artifact to R2
- Redis cache for top-K per user

## Evaluation

Log Precision@10 on train runs. Track research cost in `research_runs`.

## Constraints

- No Python / external reco SaaS as primary ranker
- No LLM in final ranking loop (LLM for research/enrichment only)
- Deterministic unit tests with mocked LLM responses

## Agent

Use `/machine-learning-expert` for algorithm changes; `/tdd` for implementation.
